OpenCharly fork of Qwen3-TTS
============================

This repository is a fork of https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-TTS at commit
022e286b98fbec7e1e916cb940cdf532cd9f488e (upstream version 0.1.1).

Upstream copyright and license notices are retained verbatim in LICENSE and in the
source headers. The following files were modified by opencharly in 2026:

- pyproject.toml        fork version (0.1.1.post1) and project URLs
- qwen_tts/__init__.py  define __version__, export the public classes, resolve them lazily
- qwen_tts/inference/qwen3_tts_model.py
                         use the instruction policy module below (upstream discarded silently)
- qwen_tts/py.typed     ship the marker the upstream package-data declared

Files added: qwen_tts/inference/instruct.py (the dependency-free instruction policy),
tests/, .github/workflows/ci.yml, .github/workflows/tag-on-merge.yml, NOTICE, FORK.md,
AGENTS.md.

No Qwen or Alibaba trademark is claimed; this is an independent fork.
